# Copy to .env.local for local dev; set the same key in the Vercel dashboard.

# Metals data provider — metalpriceapi.com.
#
# SERVER-ONLY. Never prefix this with NEXT_PUBLIC_, and never read it from a "use client"
# component — either one ships the key inside the JavaScript bundle, where anyone can
# read it with View Source.
#
# ⚠️  The key that was hardcoded in the old app/components/GoldPrices.tsx must be treated
# as COMPROMISED. It is public in two places: the git history of this repo, and the
# minified JS the old site still serves to every visitor. Rotate it in the metalpriceapi
# dashboard and put the NEW key here.
METAL_PRICE_API_KEY=

# No mail provider is needed. The site has no contact form — the email address on the
# contact page IS the contact path, so there is nothing to relay and nothing to break.
